 eceive critical acclaim.\n\nBrendan performed as a “New Face” in the 20
 22 Just For Laughs Comedy Festival. He has also taken part in the Rogue Isl
 and Comedy Festival\, Skankfest\, and the New York Comedy Festival. He was 
