 lub Competition\, and 2017’s Carolines March Madness Competition.\n\nHe h
 as written for MTV's Joking Off\, and appeared on ViceTV’s Tumbleweeds wi
 th Killer Mike and the popular Barstool Sports series Answer the Internet.\
 n\nHe is a recurring guest on The Jim and Sam Show\, Barstool Sports’ KFC
